{"id":"vod_bf_8205","vodId":"8205","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"赌博默示录：破戒录篇","name_cn":"赌博默示录：破戒录篇","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-9/9bb02163daccff18a396176b2fe05fb1.jpg"},"summary":"在与帝爱组会长兵藤和尊（津嘉山正種 配音）的对决中，伊藤开司（萩原聖人 配音）马失前蹄，欠下对方高达一千万日元的债务。由于无力偿还，开司被帝爱组投入地下的设施内进行强制劳动。在接下来的15年里，他将毫无希望地在这所人间地狱内工作直到还清所有帐务。而逃出这里的唯一希望就是那张“1日外出券”。地狱有地狱的法则，外出券需要付出相当大数额的代笔来获取。为了那一线希望，开司再次投入赌局之中。相比地上世界的赌坊，这里充满了更多的欲望、贪婪、诱惑以及罪恶。对开司来说，这无疑是一次刀尖上的舞蹈……　　本片根据日本漫画家福本伸行的原著改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 00:24:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dubomoshilupojielupian/第13集/index.